  "solution": {
    "text": "\\mathrm{KCl} x & =-1 & \\mathrm{KClO}_{3}\r\n\r\npotassium chloride $+1+x-6=0$\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\nx=+5\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\npotassium chlorate.\r\n\r\n$\\therefore$ Ratio of oxidation state of $\\mathrm{Cl}=\\frac{-1}{5}$",
